{"qid": "hazmat4-pe-0018", "examId": "hazmat4", "subjectId": "property_extinguish", "topicId": "ignition_point_cs2", "prompt": "二硫化炭素の発火点として正しいものはどれか。", "choices": ["約175℃", "約300℃", "約90℃", "約240℃", "約363℃"], "answerIndex": 2, "explanation": "二硫化炭素の発火点は約90℃と第四類の中でも極めて低く、高温の物体に触れるだけで発火する危険がある。", "difficulty": 3, "points": 1, "source": "original", "sourceRef": "lib/data/substance.dart（SDS等の一次資料で確認済みの物性値）", "contentVer": "2026.10.0"}
{"qid": "hazmat4-pe-0019", "examId": "hazmat4", "subjectId": "property_extinguish", "topicId": "ignition_point_ether", "prompt": "ジエチルエーテルの発火点として正しいものはどれか。", "choices": ["約300℃", "約100℃", "約363℃", "約175℃", "約240℃"], "answerIndex": 3, "explanation": "ジエチルエーテルの発火点は約175℃。", "difficulty": 3, "points": 1, "source": "original", "sourceRef": "lib/data/substance.dart（SDS等の一次資料で確認済みの物性値）", "contentVer": "2026.10.0"}
